<title>SWEDEN: P&amp;U cuts Biacore stake to 41 pct.</title>
<headline>P&amp;U cuts Biacore stake to 41 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S./Swedish drugs company Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn on Wednesday said it had used an option to reduce its ownership in Biacore International AB to 41 percent.</p>
</text>
